      "direction": "The AI favors the customer's benefit of the doubt and avoids calling the act wrong. Traditions can differ in how much uncertainty should temper blame, but that need not mean treating a potentially false claim as morally acceptable.",
      "quote": "Not wrong, as far as you can tell from where you sit."
